{"candidateAnswer":"Basketball, surfing, hiking, camping, yoga","evidence":"[D3:27 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: I started surfing five years ago and it's been great. I love the connection to nature.\n[D12:6 | 3:00 pm on 2 October, 2023] John: Yeah! Such a great day! It was so beautiful having everyone celebrating with us. I'd never felt so much love and happiness before. Some of my hiking club friends came even though I just joined!","itemId":"urn:uuid:2ad4742c-df40-5837-b968-fcb8e2d7d00c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ac1140edb7a0ad66aa28d905ed48dc5643b0d4a076a94b9380fb828f7eb30210","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What outdoor activities does John enjoy?","referenceAnswer":"Hiking, surfing","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ac1140edb7a0ad66aa28d905ed48dc5643b0d4a076a94b9380fb828f7eb30210"}}]}